{"Multiple goroutines hitting the cache path concurrently will all see ret == nil, wait for the write lock, and each reload the manifest even if another goroutine has already populated entryPointAssetsCache while they were blocked. This defeats caching under load and can serialize repeated CDN/disk reads on startup. Need to re-check the cache once the write lock is held so only the first goroutine performs the expensive I/O.": 0.9691916704177856}